{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓劇《魷魚遊戲》男星李政宰最近被爆持有的公司Artist Company大股東享有特權及追求個人利益，疑是「自肥式經營」，公司已發聲明全面否認。</p><p>而李政宰昨晚出席《第47屆青龍電影頒獎禮》，頒發已故影帝安聖基的「功勞獎」，是其公司爆出爭議後首</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:01.859983+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:02:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:14.435224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:14.435224+00:00","content_hash":"8f27cac1a24e392f2b426c6e9201b664cb0c4db523a0ea6db874b182046d03a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}